WEBVTT

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.183
9

00:03:30.183 --> 00:03:31.232
8

00:03:31.232 --> 00:03:32.453
7

00:03:32.453 --> 00:03:33.173
6

00:03:33.173 --> 00:03:36.477
Space shuttle bersiap untuk berangkat,
mulai,

00:03:36.477 --> 00:03:37.407
2

00:03:37.407 --> 00:03:38.283
1

00:03:38.283 --> 00:03:42.583
penyalaan pendorong,
dan peluncuran <i>Space Shuttle Discovery</i>,

00:03:42.583 --> 00:03:46.317
kembali ke Stasiun Luar Angkasa,
membuka jalan ...

00:03:46.317 --> 00:03:57.884
(<i>Space Shuttle</i> lepas landas)

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.311
Chris Hadfield:
Ini sungguh luar biasa